# Project Management Checklist Item
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Project Management — one to-do line inside a Card's checklist
# Case 19 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: pm-card.menata
#
# Split out from pm-card.menata (corrected 2026-07-11): originally an inline
# `Table of (...)` field. Already fully expressible as an ordinary Object References
# pattern (001-object.md §Relationships) — "a Card has many Checklist Items" is
# implied by "each Checklist Item references one Card," no separate grammar needed.

Checklist Item

Fields

- Card : Card
- Item Text : Text
- Done : Boolean
- Position : Number

Events

When Check

    Done True

When Uncheck

    Done False

Constraints

- Item Text is required.

Permissions

Member

- Check
- Uncheck
- Edit

Views

- Checklist Item List : List
